    "product_faq_AN4MX6": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_pjbt7r": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Full Ingredient List",
            "answer": "<p><strong>INGREDIENTS</strong>: Water (Aqua), Rosa Damascena (Rose) Flower Water, Glycerin, Chamomilla Recutita (Chamomile) Flower Water, Melissa Officinalis (Lemon Balm) Leaf Water, Lactobacillus Ferment, Lactobacillus, Lactic Acid (plant based), Sorbitan Oleate Decylglucoside Crosspolymer (plant-based), Cananga Odorata (Ylang Ylang) Flower Water, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Fruit Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Citrus Grandis (Grapefruit) Seed Extract, Chamomilla Recutita (Chamomile) Flower Extract, Citrullus Lanatus (Watermelon) Seed Extract, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Peel Oil, Salvia Sclarea (Clary) Oil, Santalum Album (Sandalwood) Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Oil, Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil, Eucalyptus Globulus (Eucalyptus) Leaf Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Oil, Fragrance, Linalool, Limonene, Citral, Beta-caryophyllene, Linalyl Acetate, Pinene Camphor, Acetyl Cedrene, Cedrus Atlantica Oil/Extract, ISO E SUPER, Juniperus Virginiana Oil.<br/><br/>Scent: The word “fragrance” on our label represents a sophisticated composition of essential oils, natural extracts, and isolates. Each element in our ingredient list is chosen for performance and safety. Our formulas are made without parabens and phthalates. Our blends follow IFRA + EU allergen standards ensuring the highest benchmarks for skin compatibility. We believe scent should enhance your experience, not compromise your health or the planet.</p>"
          }
        },
